Tool: get_order_details
Description: Retrieve details of a specific order.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "order_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Order Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "order_id"
      ]
    }
